# Cloudflare Pages security headers — apps/docs (pre-HN-launch hardening).
#
# This file is copied verbatim into the build output by Docusaurus (anything
# in `static/` lands at the site root) and consumed by Cloudflare Pages at
# request time. See: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# Target: securityheaders.com B+ or better post-deploy.
#
# CSP notes:
#   - script-src: 'self' + Plausible Analytics (plausible.io) for usage stats.
#     Docusaurus injects its bundle from /assets/* (same-origin), which 'self'
#     covers. Algolia DocSearch UI is React-rendered (no remote <script>).
#   - style-src: includes 'unsafe-inline' because Docusaurus injects inline
#     <style> blocks for the syntax highlighter and theme tokens; this is
#     the documented Docusaurus baseline and cannot be removed without
#     forking the framework. Tracked as DEBT-CSP-DOCS-INLINE-STYLE.
#   - connect-src: Plausible (analytics) + Algolia DocSearch search index.
#   - img-src: data: + https: kept permissive for embedded screenshots.
#   - frame-ancestors 'none' (no embedding the docs site in iframes).
#   - no frame-src needed — docs never embeds Stripe / Clerk.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://plausible.io; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://plausible.io https://*.algolia.net https://*.algolianet.com https://*.algolia.io; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: interest-cohort=(), camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
